tools/java-perf-test/bin/
# Operator-created soak client configs hold live Confluent Cloud API keys, and
# the soak README instructs creating them inside the working tree. `.config` is
# matched by no other rule here, so they would show up as untracked and be one
# `git add -A` from a committed secret. `ccloud.config.example` carries no
# credentials and is not matched by `*.config`.
/bindings/python/soak/*.config

